 built absent           | scan same
 built exists           | scan same
 built exists in        | scan same
 built not exists       | scan same
 built null element     | scan same
 built group            | plain same
 built int contains     | scan same
 built int two          | scan same
 built int exists       | plain same
 built int null element | scan same
